This character won on PC Nethack (legitimately).  Since I didn't have any handy
screen capture utility running, I had to type all this information in from
PrtScreen dumps, so if there are any spelling or other errors that is the
reason.  (I didn't bother to include inventory letters in the inventory list.)
A nice feature to add would be to allow all this information to be routed to a 
file in addition to displaying it on the screen to make these posts easier and 
more error-free.  This is my first winning character, BTW.

I could have been much greedier gold- and gem-wise, but carrying capacity was
limited and I figured as long as I won, getting those few extra points didn't
really matter.  I did drop most of my gold to carry gems, though.

Anyhow, here goes:


