Spoilers:

I did do the sink/black pudding/altar trick once I found a level with a sink
near an altar to get in good with my god.  I also did a little bit of
polypiling to get a couple of items.  I got the dragon scale mail by a corpse
polymorph.  Total wishes for the game: 5, only from WoW in the castle, had one
charge, then I charged it up to 3, then I got the extra charge out of it once
it was at 0.  I was pretty wimpy on my wishes (two were for blessed potions of 
gain ability, the rest were pretty unspectaular too).  The good stuff was
gotten by other means:  Mjollnir from my altar, luckstone and bag of holding
from a bones level.  All in all, a pretty unspectaular character equipmentwise.
